    "categoryTitle": "IHMAAA",
    "created": "2022-02-02 06:51:47",
    "introtext": "<p><img class=\"img-border\" title=\"\" src=\"/images/page-banner/prsi-pic.jpg\" alt=\"\" align=\"right\" /></p>\r\n<p>Dear All,</p>\r\n<p>It gives me great delight in informing you of the IHMAAA, IHM Ahmedabad Alumni Association being formed. An interactive forum to meet and discuss the matters of common interest.</p>\r\n<p>We all from IHM Ahmedabad know &amp; acknowledge the enriching influences of our Alma Mater in our lives. We would not be what we are today if we had missed out on IHM Ahmedabad.</p>\r\n<p>As the IHMAAA members are present all across the globe and doing exceedingly well in their professional &amp; personal lives we think <strong>it\u2019s time to give back what we can to the betterment of our brethren - our juniors now at the Institute, Campus, placements, assisting the needy with financial assistance and promote other matters with a single objective</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>IHM Ahmedabad takes pride in her sons &amp; daughters achievements as well as in their returning to ensure her place in the sun always.</p>\r\n<p>We look forward to your feedback on how to catalyze the efforts &amp; activities of the Alumni. As in this case<br /><cite>\"</cite>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Too many cooks will prepare an excellent broth!</strong> <cite>\"</cite></p>",
    "fulltext": "",
    "contentHtml": "<p><img class=\"img-border\" title=\"\" src=\"/images/page-banner/prsi-pic.jpg\" alt=\"\" align=\"right\" /></p>\r\n<p>Dear All,</p>\r\n<p>It gives me great delight in informing you of the IHMAAA, IHM Ahmedabad Alumni Association being formed. An interactive forum to meet and discuss the matters of common interest.</p>\r\n<p>We all from IHM Ahmedabad know &amp; acknowledge the enriching influences of our Alma Mater in our lives. We would not be what we are today if we had missed out on IHM Ahmedabad.</p>\r\n<p>As the IHMAAA members are present all across the globe and doing exceedingly well in their professional &amp; personal lives we think <strong>it\u2019s time to give back what we can to the betterment of our brethren - our juniors now at the Institute, Campus, placements, assisting the needy with financial assistance and promote other matters with a single objective</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>IHM Ahmedabad takes pride in her sons &amp; daughters achievements as well as in their returning to ensure her place in the sun always.</p>\r\n<p>We look forward to your feedback on how to catalyze the efforts &amp; activities of the Alumni. As in this case<br /><cite>\"</cite>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Too many cooks will prepare an excellent broth!</strong> <cite>\"</cite></p>",
