    "fulltext": "<div style=\"margin-left: 30px; margin-top: 25px;\">Outstanding Personality - Ms. Anushka Dias / Mr. Arnold Aron<br /><br /> Favourite \u201cMost Popular\u201d \u2013 Mr. Paurush Arora<br /><br /> Gem at Heart \u201cHelpful\u201d - Mr. Karan Bulchandani<br /><br /> Most well groomed \u201cSmarty\u201d - Ms. Ankita Paul / Mr. Shovan Arora<br /><br /> Revolution / Metamorphosis / Delta - Ms. Swati Takkar / Mr. Jaymin Panchal<br /><br /> Bravery / Chivalry / Recognition - Mr. Darpan Khare<br /><br /> Talent / Music / Dance - Binwant Sidhu<br /><br /> Favourite Hostellite - Hemant Mohta<br /><br /> Favourite Hostellite - Akanksha Deshpande<br /><br /> Notorious But Still Desired - Mr.Girish Patil / Ms. Taarika Kapoor<br /><br /></div>",
    "contentHtml": "<p><a href=\"/social-views/photo-albums?album=Awards-Farewell-2014-Batch\" target=\"_parent\"><img class=\"img-border\" src=\"/images/newspics/ihmaaa2014_awards.jpg\" /></a></p>\r\n<p><strong>\u00a0Dr. J. K. Mangaraj</strong> - Principal IHM Ahemdabad, Distributed <a href=\"/social-views/photo-albums?album=Awards-Farewell-2014-Batch\" target=\"_parent\"><span style=\"color: #0c426f;\">IHMAAA Alumni Awards At Farewell 2014 Batch</span></a></p>\n<div style=\"margin-left: 30px; margin-top: 25px;\">Outstanding Personality - Ms. Anushka Dias / Mr. Arnold Aron<br /><br /> Favourite \u201cMost Popular\u201d \u2013 Mr. Paurush Arora<br /><br /> Gem at Heart \u201cHelpful\u201d - Mr. Karan Bulchandani<br /><br /> Most well groomed \u201cSmarty\u201d - Ms. Ankita Paul / Mr. Shovan Arora<br /><br /> Revolution / Metamorphosis / Delta - Ms. Swati Takkar / Mr. Jaymin Panchal<br /><br /> Bravery / Chivalry / Recognition - Mr. Darpan Khare<br /><br /> Talent / Music / Dance - Binwant Sidhu<br /><br /> Favourite Hostellite - Hemant Mohta<br /><br /> Favourite Hostellite - Akanksha Deshpande<br /><br /> Notorious But Still Desired - Mr.Girish Patil / Ms. Taarika Kapoor<br /><br /></div>",
